# The Gold Standards: Argon2id & Bcrypt 🏆

## 1. Argon2id (Winner of the Password Hashing Competition)

**Argon2id** is the official state-of-the-art recommendation by OWASP. It is **memory-hard**, requiring substantial RAM to calculate, rendering GPU and ASIC hardware brute-force attacks useless.

## 2. Bcrypt

A battle-tested adaptive hashing algorithm based on the Blowfish cipher. Supported by every major programming language.

```javascript_not
const bcrypt = require('bcrypt');

// Hash password with cost factor 12
const saltRounds = 12;
const hashedPassword = await bcrypt.hash(rawPassword, saltRounds);

// Verify password on login
const isMatch = await bcrypt.compare(candidatePassword, hashedPassword);
```
